---
title: Today I ...
description: A collection of things I found interesting at the time.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections:
  - TIL
eleventyNavigation:
  key: TIL
---

h1.no-animation
  | Today I ...
  br
  span.lead [ Found, Learned, Saw, Read, Experienced, Grew ]
p.lead.text-center
  | A collection of things I found interesting at the time.
p.text-center
  a(href='/til/rss.xml' target='_blank')
    img(alt='rss download beacon' src='/files/rss.svg' height='20' width='20')
.row
  .col-md-8.offset-md-2
    div.list-group
      - var compareDates = function(a, b) { return new Date(b.date) - new Date(a.date); }
      each item in collections.TIL.slice().sort(compareDates)
        a.list-group-item(href=item.url)
          .row
            .col-auto
              | #{item.data.title}
            .col.align-self-end.text-right
              time(datetime=new Date(item.date).toISOString())
                | #{new Date(item.date).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { timeZone: 'UTC' })}



  



